Z||000000||FieroGT||06-06-2000||05:54 PM||||I saw a supplier of carbon fiber dash kits at Carlisle,PA last weekend and wanted to let you guys know that the kits are really nice for $115. Includes instrument apnel surround, shift console trim, aux. gages plate, radio/HVAC face plate, ashtray door covers and an insert for the map pocket. Can be had in carbon fiber or an assortment of woodgrains. Check it out at <A HREF="http://www.daytonadashmfg.com" TARGET=_blank>www.daytonadashmfg.com</A>  and let me know what you think. I'll be getting one of these kits soon!<P>John ||||reg||14
Z||000001||BroCar 87||06-06-2000||11:16 PM||||HEY FIEROGT, Heres another one for $90.00. This is the one I plan on getting. <A HREF="http://members.xoom.com/dlagrua/turbo.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.xoom.com/dlagrua/turbo.htm</A> <P>||||reg||1
