Z||000004||FieroGT||06-07-2000||11:08 AM||||Brocar 87- The guy who's website you mention is Dennis Lagrua. I've had some cyber conversations with him on the Fiero Mailing List in the past. He seems like a really good guy, and very knowledgeable about turbocharging. Pity if he is getting out of the business, from what I understand, he is a good resource to the Fiero community. Hope he's not selling his car, too. <P>Later, guys!<P>John||||reg||1
Z||000005||Oreif||06-07-2000||11:28 AM||||I just ordered the carbon fiber dash kit from Daytona Dash (FieroGT, Thanks for the link!!) The cost is $150 for the regular kit and $160 if you have the glove box. This is so far the best prices I've seen (aside from Dennis Lagruas')and it is real carbon fiber. The only thing is they make them per order so there is a 2.5 to 4 week wait before they ship. When I get the kit and install it I'll post pics.||||reg||1
