Z||000007||fropuff||06-07-2000||03:00 PM||||Fiero GT, this is the weirdest thing; He is selling his car!!!  I was one that was thinking about buying it.  He also has a wood dash in his car.  I saw it on Classifieds2000.  he lives in NJ and I would have bought it if I didn't live in MN.  It's worth looking at.  It's very nice.  If anyone's looking for an 85 GT, auto, red, $1200 in new parts, Dennis LaGrua is the one to talk to.  I think it's around $2200 or something.  He's also a very nice guy.||||reg||10
Z||000008||Oreif||06-08-2000||03:12 AM||||The Fiero store sells the kits for $349.00 !!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> I just paid $150 for my real carbon fiber kit! Most places charge anywhere from $150 to $275 That I have found on the internet. Also some places sell kits that use plastic carbon fiber and charge you the same price as real carbon fiber! You have to be very careful what you buy. Ask questions and get what YOU want. It's like buying wood furniture, do you want real wood or pressed fiberboard with "real wood laminate". I guess the next step is "Genuine Imitation Leather" (LOL,LOL) ||||reg||1
